(7469791, 1186025, 63218, '<td valign="top">I can''t explain it ''cos I don''t understand it, but unconsciously, subconsciously...I''m fascinated. At first it didn''t connect, now...I''m waiting for enlightenment.  Cool. This is very close to what I remember from the days of film &amp; an unintentional double exposure that created mystery &amp; magic for me.  So, thanks.<br/> <br/>Oh, I forgot to say--excellent points for composition &amp; framing.</td>', 'I can''t explain it ''cos I don''t understand it, but unconsciously, subconsciously...I''m fascinated. At first it didn''t connect, now...I''m waiting for enlightenment.  Cool. This is very close to what I remember from the days of film & an unintentional double exposure that created mystery & magic for me.  So, thanks. Oh, I forgot to say--excellent points for composition & framing.', '2016-08-26 13:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
